  <Info>
    <Parent Key="cef09a37-ed47-4c66-9ec8-e2ddf9f50f18">B1.3.1 Sensitively integrating with the urban grain</Parent>
    <Path>/HomePage/ChapterList/B1StrengtheningLocalCharacterAndContext/B13DevelopmentPatterns/B131SensitivelyIntegratingWithTheUrbanGrain/GuidanceG110</Path>
    <Trashed>false</Trashed>
